1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 9=

2
00:01:10,220 --> 00:01:11,420
I'm going to kill you!

3
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:13,980
What are you doing?

4
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:15,060
Sister.

5
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:16,260
Aim better next time.

6
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:17,420
Hit me right here.

7
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:19,020
That should help you vent your anger.

8
00:01:19,020 --> 00:01:20,140
Don't think I won't do it!

9
00:01:20,220 --> 00:01:21,540
Haven't you caused enough trouble?

10
00:01:22,100 --> 00:01:23,780
Wasn't what happened
today humiliating enough?

11
00:01:23,780 --> 00:01:25,060
Must you make another scene tonight?

12
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:25,820
Dad.

13
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:28,420
He sent women to my husband's bed.

14
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:30,740
He sent a woman to kill my husband.

15
00:01:30,820 --> 00:01:32,020
Instead of trusting your own family,

16
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:34,260
you believe all those rumors
from outsiders.

17
00:01:34,380 --> 00:01:35,820
Who says he's family?

18
00:01:36,980 --> 00:01:38,860
An illegitimate son
who came out of nowhere.

19
00:01:38,980 --> 00:01:40,780
Does he really think he's part
of the Kuang family?

20
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:41,420
You...

21
00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:46,340
Right now,

22
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:48,620
even if you won't think
about the family,

23
00:01:48,820 --> 00:01:50,540
you should at least consider
your own situation.

24
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:52,820
The Japanese have already taken over

25
00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:54,260
most of our family businesses.

26
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:55,300
And what little we have left

27
00:01:55,380 --> 00:01:57,420
has plenty of people
waiting to snatch it away.

28
00:01:57,420 --> 00:01:58,620
Can't you see?

29
00:01:59,420 --> 00:02:00,620
When I'm gone,

30
00:02:01,020 --> 00:02:02,180
if you don't rely on Mengde,

31
00:02:02,180 --> 00:02:02,980
who will you rely on?

32
00:02:03,340 --> 00:02:05,140
This useless son of yours?

33
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:14,460
Lv Mengde killed
a member of the Kuang family

34
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:17,460
and brought shame upon us.

35
00:02:18,660 --> 00:02:20,100
And you're still protecting him?

36
00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:23,540
So what?

37
00:02:29,220 --> 00:02:30,020
Fine.

38
00:02:31,020 --> 00:02:32,660
If you won't stand up for me, Dad,

39
00:02:33,020 --> 00:02:34,260
I'll take matters into my own hands.

40
00:02:37,220 --> 00:02:37,900
Guards!

41
00:02:37,900 --> 00:02:39,220
Drag her back to her room

42
00:02:39,220 --> 00:02:40,020
and lock her up.

43
00:02:42,900 --> 00:02:44,500
Lv Mengde!

44
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:44,940
Just you wait!

45
00:02:44,940 --> 00:02:45,620
I'll kill you!

46
00:02:45,620 --> 00:02:46,420
Lv Mengde!

47
00:02:47,060 --> 00:02:48,860
Let go of me!

48
00:02:58,460 --> 00:03:00,300
Seems everyone wants to kill me.

49
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:23,460
Uncle Mengde.

50
00:03:32,620 --> 00:03:33,500
My dear nephew.

51
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,260
Do you want to kill me too?

52
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:45,300
Mengde, what are you doing now?

53
00:03:49,300 --> 00:03:50,060
Uncle Mengde.

54
00:03:52,420 --> 00:03:53,460
Let me light your cigarette.

55
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:23,600
(To Mr. Ding Zhao)
Don't write letters like this again.

56
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:25,860
Do you think killing Lv Mengde

57
00:04:26,380 --> 00:04:28,220
will get justice for Xiaozhu?

58
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:30,340
Do you know what kind
of organization the Kun Society is?

59
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:32,420
The criminal underworld and respectable
society are all mixed together,

60
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:34,020
united by profit.

61
00:04:34,580 --> 00:04:35,900
They protect one another.

62
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:38,620
How could you possibly win

63
00:04:38,980 --> 00:04:39,940
by accusing him in front of them?

64
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:41,940
I know.

65
00:04:43,220 --> 00:04:46,350
That's why I never intended
to accuse him.

66
00:04:48,060 --> 00:04:49,250
I only wanted to kill him.

67
00:04:54,310 --> 00:04:55,060
And then what?

68
00:04:55,820 --> 00:04:57,020
I'd have to collect your body,

69
00:04:58,500 --> 00:04:59,820
follow the instructions in your letter,

70
00:05:00,420 --> 00:05:01,460
and spread the information you uncovered

71
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:03,860
as gossip about the rich and powerful,

72
00:05:04,020 --> 00:05:06,580
hoping the public would care enough
to demand justice.

73
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:10,580
The dead can't defend themselves.

74
00:05:12,100 --> 00:05:13,930
I want Lv Mengde to know

75
00:05:15,220 --> 00:05:17,980
what it's like to die in disgrace.

76
00:05:24,420 --> 00:05:25,220
Mei Yuhe.

77
00:05:25,660 --> 00:05:27,220
Every day, Shanghai sees dozens,

78
00:05:27,220 --> 00:05:28,500
even hundreds of news stories.

79
00:05:28,620 --> 00:05:29,780
Is sacrificing your life

80
00:05:29,780 --> 00:05:31,100
for a brief moment of attention

81
00:05:31,100 --> 00:05:32,260
really worth it?

82
00:05:34,820 --> 00:05:35,900
Of course not.

83
00:05:38,420 --> 00:05:39,660
That's why this letter

84
00:05:41,050 --> 00:05:42,620
was only half of my plan.

85
00:05:43,780 --> 00:05:44,660
You're right.

86
00:05:45,300 --> 00:05:47,100
The Kun Society mixes criminals
with respectable figures.

87
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:48,460
They're united by profit,

88
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:51,860
so profit can also tear them apart.

89
00:05:52,620 --> 00:05:54,940
Lv Mengde has only been back
in Shanghai for four years,

90
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:56,780
yet he's already become so powerful.

91
00:05:57,700 --> 00:05:59,540
There's no way Boss Ren
doesn't see him as a threat.

92
00:06:00,260 --> 00:06:02,900
You want to use revenge as a pretext

93
00:06:03,420 --> 00:06:04,460
to turn them against each other.

94
00:06:04,500 --> 00:06:05,820
Even if I can't kill him,

95
00:06:06,300 --> 00:06:07,860
I won't let him get away unscathed.

96
00:06:09,900 --> 00:06:11,260
But it's a risky move.

97
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:15,060
Do you know

98
00:06:15,780 --> 00:06:17,500
how fabric is woven?

99
00:06:18,380 --> 00:06:21,460
The warp
and weft threads must interlace,

100
00:06:21,780 --> 00:06:23,900
forming a strong, stable structure.

101
00:06:25,060 --> 00:06:26,460
But no matter how strong it is,

102
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:28,580
once someone pulls a loose thread,

103
00:06:28,580 --> 00:06:29,860
the whole thing can unravel.

104
00:06:31,020 --> 00:06:31,820
And now,

105
00:06:32,420 --> 00:06:34,220
we've found that loose thread.

106
00:06:35,020 --> 00:06:37,460
Don't you want to pull it?

107
00:06:38,420 --> 00:06:39,220
Of course I do.

108
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:43,220
Mr. Jing.

109
00:06:43,820 --> 00:06:44,820
What brings you here?

110
00:06:45,180 --> 00:06:46,180
Sorry to interrupt you both.

111
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:48,220
I came to ask Miss Mei

112
00:06:48,820 --> 00:06:50,140
whether she'd like Xiaozhu's body

113
00:06:50,340 --> 00:06:51,540
moved to a hospital
in the French Concession.

114
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:53,340
I know a doctor I can trust

115
00:06:53,580 --> 00:06:55,020
who can preserve Xiaozhu's remains.

116
00:06:58,900 --> 00:06:59,700
Miss Mei.

117
00:07:00,100 --> 00:07:01,380
Giving her a dignified farewell

118
00:07:01,620 --> 00:07:03,140
doesn't have to interfere

119
00:07:03,260 --> 00:07:04,260
with what you're planning.

120
00:07:04,820 --> 00:07:05,900
If you die,

121
00:07:06,020 --> 00:07:07,500
who will seek justice for your sister?

122
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:12,300
It's all right.

123
00:07:13,020 --> 00:07:14,100
You can refuse.

124
00:07:14,620 --> 00:07:15,540
Don't worry.

125
00:07:16,020 --> 00:07:17,060
Why would you worry?

126
00:07:17,620 --> 00:07:18,980
I'm here to help you.

127
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:21,140
The funeral date has been set.

128
00:07:21,300 --> 00:07:22,100
The day after tomorrow,

129
00:07:22,260 --> 00:07:23,740
at the cathedral
in the French Concession.

130
00:07:24,060 --> 00:07:26,220
Reporters will be there too.

131
00:07:26,300 --> 00:07:27,180
Mr. Jing.

132
00:07:28,020 --> 00:07:30,060
A funeral isn't
a publicity stunt for you.

133
00:07:30,060 --> 00:07:31,900
Can the Kun Society's stage

134
00:07:32,220 --> 00:07:33,700
become your chance to seek justice?

135
00:07:34,460 --> 00:07:35,700
That's up to you.

136
00:07:36,820 --> 00:07:37,780
As I've said before,

137
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:39,340
regardless of the outcome,

138
00:07:40,020 --> 00:07:41,980
giving Xiaozhu a proper

139
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:43,060
and dignified farewell

140
00:07:43,580 --> 00:07:44,780
would still be a good thing.

141
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:52,900
Then we'll do as Mr. Jing suggests.

142
00:07:53,020 --> 00:07:53,820
Miss Mei.

143
00:07:54,380 --> 00:07:55,380
As for Mr. Ding,

144
00:07:55,820 --> 00:07:57,020
my adoptive father wants
you at the Kun Society.

145
00:07:57,380 --> 00:07:57,980
Boss Ren?

146
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:59,060
He's going alone?

147
00:07:59,180 --> 00:07:59,860
No.

148
00:07:59,860 --> 00:08:00,660
Miss Mei.

149
00:08:00,780 --> 00:08:01,940
You have matters concerning your sister.

150
00:08:02,460 --> 00:08:05,020
He has matters
concerning his sister, too.

151
00:08:05,020 --> 00:08:05,940
What happened to Yiyi?

152
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:08,020
You'll find out when you get there.

153
00:08:08,020 --> 00:08:09,220
It's too dangerous for you to go alone.

154
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,380
Don't worry.

155
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:12,020
If my adoptive father
really wanted him dead,

156
00:08:12,060 --> 00:08:13,260
you couldn't save him anyway.

157
00:08:13,620 --> 00:08:14,420
Besides,

158
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:15,860
he has no reason to do that.

159
00:08:16,580 --> 00:08:18,380
I can guarantee, on behalf
of the Cishan Foundation,

160
00:08:18,700 --> 00:08:21,220
that Mr. Ding won't be harmed.

161
00:08:26,060 --> 00:08:26,660
Mr. Ding.

162
00:08:28,340 --> 00:08:28,900
After you.

163
00:08:43,400 --> 00:08:44,090
Miss Mei.

164
00:08:44,530 --> 00:08:45,500
The car is ready.

165
00:08:45,950 --> 00:08:46,980
We can leave now too.

166
00:08:54,220 --> 00:08:55,420
I need you to investigate
someone for me.

167
00:08:55,860 --> 00:08:56,740
Lv Mengde?

168
00:09:02,860 --> 00:09:03,900
Investigate him,

169
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:07,780
and I'll make sure your family
and Mei Yuhe stay safe.

170
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:20,060
I can investigate him for you.

171
00:09:28,860 --> 00:09:30,100
But what about my sister?

172
00:09:31,180 --> 00:09:32,140
She's at the Kun Society.

173
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:39,180
It seems this dish isn't
to your liking, Mr. Ding.

174
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:41,380
I'll have another one prepared.

175
00:10:24,420 --> 00:10:25,300
Mr. Jing.

176
00:10:25,780 --> 00:10:27,340
What you said earlier,

177
00:10:28,020 --> 00:10:29,260
what exactly did you mean?

178
00:10:29,620 --> 00:10:30,420
Which part?

179
00:10:32,060 --> 00:10:32,940
If I die,

180
00:10:33,070 --> 00:10:34,820
who will seek justice for my sister?

181
00:10:35,020 --> 00:10:35,820
And also,

182
00:10:36,500 --> 00:10:38,820
the funeral is our chance
to seek justice.

183
00:10:40,380 --> 00:10:41,180
Miss Mei.

184
00:10:41,780 --> 00:10:45,340
I hope you'll keep
investigating this case.

185
00:10:47,020 --> 00:10:49,980
But hasn't the Kun Society already...

186
00:10:49,980 --> 00:10:51,220
That's the Kun Society's position,

187
00:10:51,620 --> 00:10:52,740
not mine.

188
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:56,460
I want you to keep investigating.

189
00:10:56,460 --> 00:10:57,260
Why?

190
00:10:58,420 --> 00:10:59,220
Miss Mei.

191
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:02,420
Do you remember Xiaozhu's scholarship?

192
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:05,380
The principal said

193
00:11:05,500 --> 00:11:07,300
it was awarded to the school's
top ten students.

194
00:11:08,140 --> 00:11:08,940
For years,

195
00:11:09,420 --> 00:11:10,860
the scholarships
at Mintong Middle School

196
00:11:11,020 --> 00:11:12,740
have been funded
by the Cishan Foundation.

197
00:11:13,380 --> 00:11:14,340
In other words,

198
00:11:15,180 --> 00:11:17,660
Xiaozhu was one of the students
I sponsored.

199
00:11:19,220 --> 00:11:20,460
I've read her essays

200
00:11:20,700 --> 00:11:21,900
and heard her presentations.

201
00:11:22,420 --> 00:11:24,660
I believe she wasn't a girl
who chased wealth and power,

202
00:11:24,780 --> 00:11:25,820
craved status,

203
00:11:26,100 --> 00:11:27,900
or lost herself in a world of luxury.

204
00:11:28,380 --> 00:11:29,620
She had great ambitions.

205
00:11:30,020 --> 00:11:31,500
She would never have sunk so low.

206
00:11:33,020 --> 00:11:34,700
I can't accept
that things ended this way.

207
00:11:35,580 --> 00:11:37,420
I want to uncover what really happened.

208
00:11:38,730 --> 00:11:40,660
But my position makes it difficult
for me to get involved.

209
00:11:42,180 --> 00:11:42,980
Miss Mei.

210
00:11:43,620 --> 00:11:44,860
If you trust me,

211
00:11:45,220 --> 00:11:46,980
please allow me to help you
behind the scenes.

212
00:11:49,620 --> 00:11:50,420
Thank you.

213
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:54,180
Dr. Bai Mali.

214
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:56,140
Have you finished restoring the body?

215
00:11:56,380 --> 00:11:57,220
Yes.

216
00:11:57,820 --> 00:11:59,020
This is Dr. Bai Mali,

217
00:11:59,020 --> 00:12:00,180
who came here from France.

218
00:12:00,610 --> 00:12:01,700
This is Mei Yuhe,

219
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:02,860
the deceased's older sister.

220
00:12:04,160 --> 00:12:04,900
Dr. Bai.

221
00:12:05,060 --> 00:12:05,900
Thank you for your help.

222
00:12:06,820 --> 00:12:07,500
Miss Mei.

223
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:08,660
I have great respect for you.

224
00:12:09,260 --> 00:12:11,660
Many Chinese people
can't accept an autopsy,

225
00:12:12,020 --> 00:12:13,700
believing it disrespects the dead.

226
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:15,460
But you're different.

227
00:12:15,700 --> 00:12:17,180
You're willing to face the truth

228
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:18,900
without fearing damage
to your reputation.

229
00:12:19,180 --> 00:12:20,860
Not everyone can do that.

230
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,220
However,

231
00:12:22,620 --> 00:12:24,220
there's a wound on her body

232
00:12:24,620 --> 00:12:25,780
that I need to ask you about.

233
00:12:26,020 --> 00:12:26,620
A wound?

234
00:12:27,860 --> 00:12:29,060
This old scar

235
00:12:29,300 --> 00:12:30,660
doesn't look like an ordinary accident.

236
00:12:32,460 --> 00:12:35,820
Yes, Xiaozhu did get it
when she was little.

237
00:12:36,620 --> 00:12:39,300
But I can't remember exactly
how it happened.

238
00:12:40,260 --> 00:12:41,900
The incision is very precise.

239
00:12:42,020 --> 00:12:43,860
I've seen wounds like this
on other patients.

240
00:12:44,380 --> 00:12:47,860
It seems to be an ancient ritual wound.

241
00:12:48,100 --> 00:12:49,060
A ritual?

242
00:12:49,420 --> 00:12:50,620
Someone told me

243
00:12:50,700 --> 00:12:52,380
there's an ancient practice in the East

244
00:12:52,700 --> 00:12:54,300
called... what was it again?

245
00:12:56,020 --> 00:12:56,820
Life swapping.

246
00:12:56,860 --> 00:12:57,620
Life swapping?

247
00:12:57,620 --> 00:12:58,300
Yes.

248
00:12:58,700 --> 00:13:00,340
Identical wounds are cut

249
00:13:00,580 --> 00:13:02,180
into two people's abdomens.

250
00:13:02,220 --> 00:13:03,180
Talismans are placed over them,

251
00:13:03,660 --> 00:13:05,540
and the two are pressed
together, skin to skin,

252
00:13:05,860 --> 00:13:06,740
so their flesh and blood can merge.

253
00:13:07,620 --> 00:13:09,260
It's usually performed on infants

254
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:11,700
to give one of them a better fate.

255
00:13:12,020 --> 00:13:14,300
I always thought it was
just a folk tale.

256
00:13:14,820 --> 00:13:15,740
But I never imagined

257
00:13:16,340 --> 00:13:17,300
someone would actually do it.

258
00:14:42,620 --> 00:14:44,740
Yuhe, what are you looking at?

259
00:14:49,900 --> 00:14:51,220
I'm looking for a way

260
00:14:52,300 --> 00:14:54,180
to live a respectable life.

261
00:14:55,380 --> 00:14:56,380
Mom and Dad said

262
00:14:57,780 --> 00:14:59,020
that to make it in Shanghai,

263
00:14:59,820 --> 00:15:01,780
we need to find ourselves a big tree.

264
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:04,900
It can shelter us from the storms

265
00:15:05,660 --> 00:15:07,980
and let us climb higher and see farther.

266
00:15:10,900 --> 00:15:12,780
Want to climb up with me
and take a look?

267
00:15:13,460 --> 00:15:14,700
I don't want to.

268
00:15:14,820 --> 00:15:16,500
I just want to go home.

269
00:15:17,780 --> 00:15:18,580
Home?

270
00:15:20,620 --> 00:15:22,500
We don't have a home anymore.

271
00:15:23,660 --> 00:15:25,140
Where did Mom and Dad go?

272
00:15:25,420 --> 00:15:27,860
Why is it just the two of us

273
00:15:27,860 --> 00:15:29,140
without Mom and Dad?

274
00:15:34,180 --> 00:15:36,380
The journey to Shanghai was too rough.

275
00:15:38,620 --> 00:15:40,260
Our boat capsized.

276
00:15:41,780 --> 00:15:42,860
Only I...

277
00:15:44,420 --> 00:15:45,140
Only we

278
00:15:46,100 --> 00:15:47,220
survived.

279
00:15:54,420 --> 00:15:55,580
But don't worry.

280
00:15:57,700 --> 00:15:59,420
I haven't forgotten

281
00:15:59,820 --> 00:16:01,180
what they taught me.

282
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:03,940
I'll make a home for you in Shanghai.

283
00:16:04,620 --> 00:16:06,140
I can be your big tree.

284
00:16:14,020 --> 00:16:14,820
Yuhe.

285
00:16:15,020 --> 00:16:16,140
It's just a school uniform.

286
00:16:16,220 --> 00:16:17,700
It doesn't matter if it fits perfectly.

287
00:16:18,380 --> 00:16:19,660
The way you dress matters.

288
00:16:20,100 --> 00:16:21,800
If you look neat and presentable,

289
00:16:21,800 --> 00:16:22,900
(Zhu)
when you go to school,

290
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:24,300
people will respect you more.

291
00:16:26,140 --> 00:16:26,940
Yuhe.

292
00:16:27,820 --> 00:16:29,220
I'll study hard.

293
00:16:30,020 --> 00:16:31,300
I promise I won't let you down.

294
00:16:32,140 --> 00:16:32,940
All right.

295
00:16:34,700 --> 00:16:36,260
Seeing you in this school uniform

296
00:16:36,700 --> 00:16:38,460
makes me so happy

297
00:16:38,720 --> 00:16:39,940
and proud.

298
00:16:40,620 --> 00:16:41,420
Oh, my!

299
00:16:41,860 --> 00:16:45,060
Our little girl is growing
into a big tree.

300
00:16:45,820 --> 00:16:46,620
Yuhe.

301
00:16:47,260 --> 00:16:48,820
One day, I'll be your big tree.

302
00:16:49,100 --> 00:16:50,300
I'll take you to France.

303
00:16:50,580 --> 00:16:51,580
I'll show you all
the beautiful clothes there.

304
00:16:51,580 --> 00:16:52,300
How does that sound?

305
00:16:52,380 --> 00:16:53,100
You promise?

306
00:16:53,100 --> 00:16:53,780
I promise.

307
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:10,500
I don't even know

308
00:17:12,020 --> 00:17:14,140
if sending you to Mintong Middle School

309
00:17:14,610 --> 00:17:15,980
was the right decision.

310
00:17:18,220 --> 00:17:19,060
Did we

311
00:17:19,060 --> 00:17:21,140
wander into a place we shouldn't have

312
00:17:22,620 --> 00:17:24,820
and uncover things
we shouldn't have known?

313
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:32,980
(Zhu)
No matter what,

314
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,900
I won't break my promise.

315
00:17:39,020 --> 00:17:39,820
Xiaozhu.

316
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:42,180
Go on ahead.

317
00:17:43,100 --> 00:17:46,340
I'll make sure you get justice.

318
00:17:57,300 --> 00:18:00,340
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

319
00:18:00,900 --> 00:18:03,740
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

320
00:18:04,380 --> 00:18:07,220
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

321
00:18:07,220 --> 00:18:09,140
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

322
00:18:09,140 --> 00:18:10,700
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

323
00:18:10,700 --> 00:18:12,660
♪But I refuse to fall♪

324
00:18:12,660 --> 00:18:17,580
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

325
00:18:17,700 --> 00:18:20,140
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

326
00:18:21,220 --> 00:18:24,220
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

327
00:18:24,540 --> 00:18:27,380
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

328
00:18:27,420 --> 00:18:30,220
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

329
00:18:30,940 --> 00:18:33,820
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

330
00:18:33,820 --> 00:18:37,020
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

331
00:18:38,500 --> 00:18:41,260
♪Those who have hurt me♪

332
00:18:41,820 --> 00:18:44,500
♪I choose to pierce through♪

333
00:18:46,100 --> 00:18:47,580
♪To tear apart♪

334
00:18:47,700 --> 00:18:53,580
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

335
00:18:55,260 --> 00:18:57,380
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

336
00:18:57,380 --> 00:19:00,300
♪Nor bow to power♪

337
00:19:00,300 --> 00:19:02,580
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

338
00:19:04,380 --> 00:19:08,300
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
